{"id":"en_she-kidnapped-me-to-solve-murders","title":"She \"Kidnapped\" Me to Solve Murders","titleEn":"She \"Kidnapped\" Me to Solve Murders","description":"After dying under unexplained circumstances, a onetime celebrated detective named Shattock gets a second chance at life and joins the force again, this time at the bottom as a rookie. A mix-up on a blind date introduces him to Officer Melissa, and the pretend romance they arrange draws him into a savage killing at a warehouse. Relying on the instincts he carried over from his previous existence, he solves cases others deem unsolvable and climbs the ranks quickly. What began as a convenient arrangement deepens into genuine feeling, and along the way he identifies Blackbone, the criminal network responsible for his death. He ultimately dismantles the syndicate, gaining justice and love together. Dramzio is where the series can be followed.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-kidnapped-me-to-solve-murders/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-kidnapped-me-to-solve-murders/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Contract Lovers","Mystery","Second Life","Male","Crime & Underworld","Comeback"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsco8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_she-kidnapped-me-to-solve-murders_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsco8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-kidnapped-me-to-solve-murders_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsco8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-kidnapped-me-to-solve-murders_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":